Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{Catzilla's Story}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.28,0:00:13.96,Thought,,0,0,0,,My name is Catherine. \NI'm a shy little maiden of four,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.96,0:00:18.40,Thought,,0,0,0,,and today I'll tell you my Cinderella story.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.40,0:00:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.89,0:00:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cute calico kitty!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.39,0:00:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.39,0:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get separated from your parents, \Nor were you abandoned?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.53,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.20,0:00:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take you home, \Nbut my dad's allergic to cats,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.17,0:00:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and my mom still remembers how the little\Nbantam chicken she adored got eaten by a cat. {(Japanese) bantam​}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.57,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She even said she'd kill a cat someday! {?? lit: she said she'd kill someday - no clue who or what}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, troubled maiden...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a total Hamlet state of mind. {literal}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.88,0:00:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,One-two...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.99,0:00:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.02,0:00:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sango-kun! {jugo sango from judo bu monogatari}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.26,0:01:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, got it. We'll take that cat in.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.93,0:01:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really? You mean it?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.93,0:01:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I was actually thinking\Nof getting a cat anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.47,0:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it'll help with practicing \Njudo breakfalls, right? {believing chatgpt}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.67,0:01:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sango-kun!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.51,0:01:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come to see this kitty every day.
Comment: 10,0:01:15.02,0:01:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.35,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.35,0:01:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's busy as it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.22,0:01:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who's going to take care of it? \NThrow it out now!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do something that cruel!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.75,0:01:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad, why can't we keep it?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.06,0:01:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, I don't know, I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.36,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.46,0:01:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute! Hey, can I hold her?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.67,0:01:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.03,0:01:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.07,0:01:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.14,0:01:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Calico-chan. \NI'll give you some sushi.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.18,0:01:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's eating it! How adorable.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.01,0:01:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it can't be helped now.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.25,0:01:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{Only because the customers seem to like her, we'll keep her for now.} We'll keep her, but only because\Nthe customers seem to like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.42,0:02:02.67,Thought,,0,0,0,,And so, blessed with beauty from birth, \NI became a member of this household.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.16,0:02:07.61,Thought,,0,0,0,,The very end seat at the counter \Nwas my favorite spot.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.61,0:02:12.13,Thought,,0,0,0,,If I flashed a little charm at the customers, \Nthey were putty in my paws!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.60,0:02:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{??}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.44,0:02:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that kitten, \Nour sales have doubled!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.84,0:02:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she really was a beckoning cat. {maneki neko}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.48,0:02:25.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,I truly was the idol of this shop.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.86,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A year passed.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.82,0:02:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.12,0:02:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What kind of beast is that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.86,0:02:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called a Catzilla. \NTechnically, it's a type of cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.03,0:02:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She's totally killing the mood!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.63,0:02:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, let's sit far away from it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.05,Overlap,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.34,0:02:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Please don't feed sliced fish to Catzilla"? I see. {sashimi }
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.91,0:02:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's toast.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.61,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, to us!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.95,0:03:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just noticed Catzilla was right there.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.59,0:03:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, dear. Here you go...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.99,0:03:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, this Catzilla is staring right at us!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, please ignore her. Don't mind her.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.41,0:03:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was Catzilla's usual trick. \NDon't fall for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.98,0:03:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what to do!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.75,0:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,People say cats' legs give out \Nif they eat squid, so let's feed her squid.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.29,0:03:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Catzilla-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.42,0:03:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you mine too. Here...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.23,0:03:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! They fed squid to Catzilla!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.36,0:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.20,0:03:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When Catzilla eats squid, \Nshe's like Popeye after eating spinach! {? idk what's that female voice in the background lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.38,0:04:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We'd better not anger her further, dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.39,0:04:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.49,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.53,0:04:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the famous actress Asaokayama-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I passed this place on my way back from a shoot.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.90,0:04:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, welcome. What can I get you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.68,0:04:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.04,0:04:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Comment: 10,0:04:34.91,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.25,0:04:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what an adorable kitty!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a cute cat like this too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.44,0:04:53.28,Thought,,0,0,0,,That was truly a fateful encounter.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.28,0:04:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One-two...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.37,0:05:11.48,Thought,,0,0,0,,So this is my current owner, \Nthe actress Asaokayama Yukijiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.48,0:05:16.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,People say the two of us together \Nare a pair of unrivaled beauties.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.47,0:05:24.09,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? \NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.09,0:05:26.59,Song,,0,0,0,,You too will be number one someday
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.59,0:05:30.13,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael?\NWhat's Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.13,0:05:33.20,Song,,0,0,0,,Now which one is number one?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.20,0:05:35.49,Song,,0,0,0,,What's Michael? Number one!
Comment: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{The Cat Coffee House}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're breaking up! {lit: let's break up [with him] - they're actually talking about michael, but they're supposed to sound like they're talking about themselves here for Isono to misunderstand it}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.22,0:05:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When we love each other so much, \Nwhy must we break up? {when we [michael and us] love each other ...}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.32,0:05:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say "break up," I'll die! {/If we break up, I'll die!}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.41,0:06:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, both of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, \Nbreaking up or not?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.46,0:06:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple this close can't possibly split up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}breaking up?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.90,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At least let me hear the reason!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.90,0:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? \NWe're talking about Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.24,0:06:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.51,0:06:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, so you're talking \Nabout breaking up with Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.55,0:06:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds great to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.52,0:06:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "great"?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.39,0:06:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, explain yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.22,0:06:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you work \Nwith such a cold editor, dear?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.72,0:06:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Isono-kun! \NThe serialization is canceled, starting this week!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.03,0:06:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a second!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.13,0:06:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone! \NI'm reporter Hojo Shino.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.47,0:06:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm standing in front of the\N{\i1}Lovely Cat Coffee House{\i0},{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}a cat cafe. {the sign said "lovely cat coffee house" but she says nekokissa = Cat coffee house so kinda not the same, but I still chose to ignore it to avoid the repetition of “cat”}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.69,0:06:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside \Nand see what it's like!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.37,0:06:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.28,0:06:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.85,0:06:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all these cats yours, sir?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.48,0:06:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They are.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.65,0:06:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can customers feed them?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.82,0:07:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.95,0:07:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what about letting them \Nsit on your lap or holding them?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.19,0:07:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.83,0:07:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet droves of cute young girls \Nflock here every day! {pichipichi gyaru = young and perky}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.73,0:07:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.70,0:07:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, looks like the customers are here!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they cute?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.16,0:07:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.19,0:07:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me, are {\i1}all{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}your customers men?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.63,0:07:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem with that?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.07,0:07:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kobayashi-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.50,0:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please take care of our Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, our marriage will be ruined.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.24,0:07:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We talked it over.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.08,0:08:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe someone like you \Ncan be trusted with Michael's future.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll accept him.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.92,0:08:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second! You doted on him\N so much. What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.85,0:08:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And you too. You're accepting \Nwithout even hearing the reason?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.36,0:08:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was our wedding anniversary.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your anniversary?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.79,0:08:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year, we exchange presents. Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.77,0:08:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.84,0:08:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, my anniversary present!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.29,0:08:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.18,0:08:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.29,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You made this cake yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.72,0:08:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Three candles, \Nsince it's our third anniversary.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.59,0:08:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, it's been three years already?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.34,0:09:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to dance your way out of it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.91,0:09:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.51,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, dear...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! My present for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.92,0:09:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You knitted it? \NWhen did you find the time?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, try it on.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.36,0:09:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this color!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.09,0:09:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it that we always end up \Nliking the same things?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.20,0:09:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect. It fits you just right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.45,0:09:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that feeling.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.54,0:09:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.70,0:09:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like humans exist \Njust to serve cats, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.60,0:09:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are so damn spoiled!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.63,0:10:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been listening intently, but I still haven't \N heard the reason you can't live with a cat! {meaning "how is that an excuse to throw your cat out"}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.08,0:10:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In my case, my wife's allergic to cats.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And me, if only I could... {?? dunno what he implies}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.26,0:10:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I live in an apartment, \Nso I really can't keep a cat. {?? i don't see how that works, perhaps "apaato" in japanese means "rented house" somehow?}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.71,0:10:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So for my sake too, \NI want you folks to really love that cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.73,0:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{No way one must fall from happiness \Nto misery in this world.} {??? lit: the guy to become happy, mustn't become, it's a lie - not sure what he means} {imatu: rewording} One mustn't fall from happiness\Ninto misery so quickly if one can avoid it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.12,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we've decided not to give him away. \NSorry for all the trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.12,0:10:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.17,0:10:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! If you ever make that cat cry, \Nyou won't get off easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.33,0:10:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.90,0:10:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.37,0:10:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.66,0:10:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.45,0:10:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.68,0:10:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.82,0:10:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, it just wouldn't be \N{\i1}our{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}home without Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.76,0:10:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We should make sure to\Nbuy a present for Michael too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Michael Pays It Back}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.49,0:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever should we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.70,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's adorable.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.53,0:11:38.70,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.83,0:11:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And they say cats these days \Ncan't even catch mice anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.37,0:11:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done mighty well, I'd say.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.21,0:11:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonsai? That can be replanted anytime.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.47,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, there was some fish paste in the fridge. {chikuwa; tube-shaped fish paste cake​}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.78,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.13,0:12:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn stray cat, \Nyou've ruined my laundry!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.42,0:12:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{???? no clue, could be anything}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.85,0:12:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you come here ever again, \Nyou mangy stray!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.74,0:12:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't learned your lesson?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.87,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.71,0:13:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.98,0:13:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.64,0:14:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.82,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.76,0:14:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You little punk, get out I said! Shoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.80,0:15:09.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,By sheer luck, Michael was treated to some\Nfried horse mackerel, so the very next day...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.21,0:15:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.86,0:15:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.92,0:15:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... I didn't expect any thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.06,0:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.81,0:15:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that... cat poop?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.57,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Message received loud and clear! \NBlack Eagle, move in! {\i0}{??? *** denpou *** burakku...}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter - Naked Michael}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.24,0:16:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's spring at last! \NWow, this feels great.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.18,0:16:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Michael. \NGo ahead and romp as much as you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.22,0:16:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, don't stray too far!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.98,0:17:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.87,0:17:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I'm coming to save you!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.94,0:17:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.43,0:18:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oh, please! If you wanted to swim,\Nyou should've just swum normally from the get-go! {instead of drowning }
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.50,0:18:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez… It's the first sunny day in a while, \Nand you let it go to waste!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.41,0:18:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, I don't understand you. {????? not a word, **** tte iya ne - maybe the first word is "fun", maybe "honto ni"}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.14,0:18:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Move aside, you klutz!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.04,0:18:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't scratch yourself there!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.02,0:18:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fur's flying everywhere!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.43,0:18:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No scratching!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.64,0:18:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.57,0:18:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.90,0:18:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "What happened?"
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.04,0:19:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.29,0:19:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.29,0:19:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{idk, probs nothing meaningful}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.13,0:19:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My manuscript...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.90,0:19:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.33,0:19:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Michael, cut it out already!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.64,0:19:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! You're bleeding!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.18,0:19:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened? \NWhy are you so itchy?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.02,0:19:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you caught some weird disease \Nwhen you fell into that pond!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.05,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get you to the vet right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.63,0:19:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.37,0:20:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Do you think \Nhe caught something serious?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.11,0:20:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just a minor skin condition.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.46,0:20:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's caused by humidity. \NIt happens a lot during the rainy season.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.18,0:20:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he going to be okay, doctor?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.05,0:20:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine. The important thing \Nis to keep things well ventilated.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.05,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some special treatment just for that. \NMa'am, hold him still.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.80,0:20:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, you must be hungry. Come!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.80,0:20:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Michael. Eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your handsome fur coat, all ruined...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.68,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm starving. \NIs there anything to eat—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.99,0:20:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't come close! \NWhat is that thing? Gross!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.89,0:21:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? \NThat's our Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.56,0:21:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Michael?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a skin condition.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.03,0:21:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, they didn't have \Nto shave all his fur off!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.67,0:21:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just cruel to Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.27,0:21:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that, but it's better \Nthan letting the skin disease spread all over!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.44,0:21:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but still…
Comment: 0,0:21:17.85,0:21:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
